<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/msa@/~cl_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “dealer” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “effective interest rate” refers to— (a) a rate that reflects the actual finance cost of a hire-purchase in the case of a hire-purchase agreement where the terms charges are at a fixed rate; or (b) a rate that reflects the actual finance cost of a hire-purchase which is determined by using the reference rate as a benchmark in the case of a hire-purchase agreement where the terms charges are at a variable rate; “electronic” has the same meaning assigned to it in the Electronic Commerce Act 2006 [Act 658];’;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/msa@/~cl_2__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/msa@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/29/msa@> .
